<h3><font color="red">Essay Argument Persuasiveness Dataset</font></h3>


<ul>
<li><a href="http://www.hlt.utdallas.edu/~zixuan/EssayScoring/persuasiveness/essays.zip">Essays and Annotations</a> Includes argument persuasiveness scores, attributes of argument components as well as the raw text. Specifically, ".txt" files are the raw essays and ".ann" files are the annotations. For example, essay001.txt is the raw text of essay001 and essay001.ann is the annotation of essay001.
</li>
</ul>

